            "Deadlock: T1 holds A wants B, T2 holds B wants A; DB aborts one",
            "Fix: lock rows in a **consistent order**",
            "High contention: pessimistic; low contention: optimistic"
          ],
          "style": "cross",
          "frame": "solid",
          "ink": "red"
        },
